	"FriendlyName": "Dream Narrative",
	"Description": "Quests, story progression and dialogue authored as text. One fact ledger underneath: dialogue reads and writes it, quests watch it, chapters gate on it. Text source files are the single source of truth - the editor is a projection that writes back to them - so the whole narrative graph is statically checkable: dead links, unreachable branches, undeclared facts.",
